1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,271
We're Dreams of X.

2
00:00:02,431 --> 00:00:05,114
For NASA's
Abandoned but not Forgotten challenge,

3
00:00:05,124 --> 00:00:07,484
we built the Moon-Material Simulator.

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,178
The machines left on the Moon

5
00:00:09,188 --> 00:00:11,060
show what it does to materials.

6
00:00:11,417 --> 00:00:13,148
Our free browser app predicts how

7
00:00:13,158 --> 00:00:15,552
NASA Glenn's bioplastic
mixed with Moon dust

8
00:00:15,562 --> 00:00:18,665
will perform, from real, audited lab data.

9
00:00:18,941 --> 00:00:21,717
Rebuild a broken part, test it in 3D,

10
00:00:21,727 --> 00:00:24,063
and see the evidence behind every number.

11
00:00:24,513 --> 00:00:26,710
Next stop: Mars.
